     crystalline metals

CT   BAND STRUCTURE; DENSITY FUNCTIONAL THEORY; MAGNETIC CIRCULAR DICHROISM;
     RELATIVISTIC BAND STRUCTURE CALCULATIONS; TRANSITION METALS; X-RAY
     ABSORPTION SPECTRA

ST   electron core-hole interaction; X-ray absorption spectroscopy; 3d
     transition metals; fully relativistic scheme; electronic band structure;
     solid; time-dependent density functional theory; linear response
     formalism; L2,3-absorption spectra; L2 partial spectra; L3 partial
     spectra; branching ratio; magnetic circular X-ray dichroism sum rules}
}


@article{PEA99,
