     A7510D Crystal-field theory and spin Hamiltonians (magnetism)

CT   COBALT ALLOYS; CPA CALCULATIONS; FERROMAGNETIC MATERIALS; IRON ALLOYS; KKR
     CALCULATIONS; MAGNETORESISTANCE; NICKEL ALLOYS; SPIN DISORDER RESISTIVITY

