     transport and mobility; piezoresistance (semiconductors/insulators);
     A7125T Band structure of crystalline semiconductor compounds and
     insulators; A7125H Measurement of Fermi surface parameters; A7120F
     Electronic density of states of nonmetallic inorganics

CT   BAND STRUCTURE; CHARGE EXCHANGE; CRYSTAL STRUCTURE; ELECTRICAL
     RESISTIVITY; ELECTRONIC DENSITY OF STATES; FERMI SURFACE; MUFFIN-TIN
     POTENTIAL; TANTALUM COMPOUNDS; TIGHT-BINDING CALCULATIONS

ST   crystal structure; electrical resistivity; TB-LMTO method; partial density
     of states; Ta zigzag chains; Te-Te network; charge transfer;
